WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
You leave HR. Your boss and two colleagues turn toward you at the elevator.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Fang: Just came out of HR? Are you planning to leave?

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Fang: Qiao is here too. Tell us together so nobody has to guess.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.500
You think: Whatever I say will get passed around…

5
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.833
You: No, no! I was just asking about… social insurance and annual leave…

6
00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:15.500
Fang: Oh—social insurance.

7
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.567
The film shows a group chat. Colleague A: At the elevator… he asked about social insurance? B: I heard he is leaving. C: Really? Has he found his next job?

8
00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:20.000
Film commentary: More explanation leads to more guessing.

9
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.533
Rewind and try another response. You: What does this have to do with you?

10
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:25.167
Fang: I am your boss. Can I not even ask a question?

11
00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:27.500
Film commentary: Privacy is protected, but the relationship suffers.

12
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.700
Rewind. You: My conversation with HR was personal. This is not the place to discuss it.

13
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:34.433
Fang: Then… will it affect the project?

14
00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:38.433
You: I am continuing the project as planned. If you are concerned, shall we set aside ten minutes this afternoon?

15
00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:43.167
Fang: All right, three o’clock. The elevator opens and the group leaves the waiting area.

16
00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:46.167
Film summary: Keep private matters out of public conversation. Discuss work separately.

17
00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:50.167
SocialCoach: Rehearse difficult conversations here first. Say the thing you have been not saying.
